    "$comment": "GDELT DOC 2.0 API for worldwide discovery. Results are headline + link only: they add corroboration and importance signals and can appear as clearly labeled headline-only entries, never as AI summaries. GDELT asks for at most one request every 5 seconds. Queries use GDELT's own syntax; sourcecountry uses country names without spaces.",
